  "details": "Follow-up to: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/publicly-attached-in-client-bug-reporting-output-log-files-are-403-forbidden\n\nIn-client bug report log files have not been public since August 17-18, 2026 (currently 403 Forbidden as intended), but the in-client bug reporting UI still says they would be public.\n\n1. Open Quick Menu, scroll down.\n\n2. Press \"Report a bug\".\n\n3. Scroll down, read the label about log files under \"Include log file\".\n\nExpected result: \"Logs will be publicly visible.\" label omitted.\n\nActual result: \"Logs will be publicly visible.\" label is shown in the dialog.\n\nAffects `Build 1903` and `Build 1913`.",
